                                "sense_id": "95514902-8071-320d-92f0-8b6717ad242c",
                                "text": "These results might indicate an enzymatic formation of urea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16446e7c-d2ac-4808-9b37-b5bf6829caa2",
                                "sense_id": "95514902-8071-320d-92f0-8b6717ad242c",
                                "text": "The later workers have attempted not only to ascertain the influence of the anion and the cation, but ti explain the reason for such influence upon the catalytic or enzymatic processes."
